  "source_findings": [
    "Fill/outline PS uses font texel.r for fill and texel.b for outline; fill also samples second texture RGB/alpha.",
    "Output RGB is alpha_fill*color_fill + alpha_outline*color_outline; output alpha is1-(alpha_fill+alpha_outline). Blend state consumer must be qualified before integration.",
    "Glow PS uses font texel.x and color alpha; outputs unmodified color RGB.",
    "VS fill/outline transforms float3 position with column-major pMtx(c4) and forwards two colors/two UVs; native color swizzle depends on compiler macros."
